---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="How to reach the Sourcedreviews editor."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <header>
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p class="summary">How to reach the Sourcedreviews editor.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>The fastest way to reach us is email:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem;"><a href="mailto:contact@sourcedreviews.com"><strong>contact@sourcedreviews.com</strong></a></p>

    <h2>What to write about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Editorial inquiries</strong> — questions about how we make recommendations, methodology, or sourcing</li>
      <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — if you spot an error in an article, please include the article URL</li>
      <li><strong>Takedown requests</strong> — if you represent a brand and would like specific content reviewed, please include the URL and a brief explanation</li>
      <li><strong>Press and partnerships</strong> — please send a short pitch in the body of the email; attachments will not be opened</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Response time</h2>
    <p>We read every message but cannot reply to all of them. Editorial and correction inquiries are typically answered within one week. Press pitches are reviewed monthly.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>